  "id": "cpg-61",
  "title": "Analgesia and Sedation Management during Prolonged Field Care",
  "description": "JTS CPG ID 61 · Published 11 May 2017 · Rapid update 01 Sep 2023",
  "section": "Prolonged Field & Casualty Care Series",
